al election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Hawaii.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Flag_of_Hawaii.svg/60px-Flag_of_Hawaii.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Flag_of_Hawaii.svg/120px-Flag_of_Hawaii.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"600\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"25\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Hawaii_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2022 Hawaii gubernatorial election\">2022</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2030</i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Josh_Green_Official_Photo_2022_(cropped)_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Josh_Green_Official_Photo_2022_(cropped)_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Josh_Green_Official_Photo_2022_%28cropped%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Josh_Green_Official_Photo_2022_%28cropped%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Josh_Green_Official_Photo_2022_%28cropped%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Josh_Green_Official_Photo_2022_%28cropped%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"265\" data-file-height=\"365\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"109\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Gary_Cordery_Hawaii.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Gary_Cordery_Hawaii.jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Gary_Cordery_Hawaii.jpg/250px-Gary_Cordery_Hawaii.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Gary_Cordery_Hawaii.jpg/330px-Gary_Cordery_Hawaii.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"919\" data-file-height=\"1080\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Josh_Green_(politician)\" title=\"Josh Green (politician)\">Josh Green</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Gary Cordery</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Running<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>mate</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Derek_Kawakami\" title=\"Derek Kawakami\">Derek Kawakami</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Daniel Anthony</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor_of_Hawaii\" title=\"Governor of Hawaii\">Governor</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Josh_Green_(politician)\" title=\"Josh Green (politician)\">Josh Green</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt1730\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwCsc\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Ifexist not redirect\",\"href\":\"./Template:Ifexist_not_redirect\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 Hawaii gubernatorial election\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"{{Main|2026 Hawaii gubernatorial election}}\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt1731\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt1730\" id=\"mwCsg\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Hawaii_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Hawaii gubernatorial election\">2026 Hawaii gubernatorial election</a></div>\n\n<p id=\"mwCsk\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor_of_Hawaii\" title=\"Governor of Hawaii\" id=\"mwCso\">Governor</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Josh_Green_(politician)\" title=\"Josh Green (politician)\" id=\"mwCss\">Josh Green</a>, a Democrat, was elected in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Hawaii_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2022 Hawaii gubernatorial election\" id=\"mwCsw\">2022</a> with 63.2% of the vote. He is running for re-election to a second term.<sup about=\"#mwt1734\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-157\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-157\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-157\" id=\"mwCs0\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwCs4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwCs8\">[</span>147<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwCtA\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt1735\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwCtE\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"23\" id=\"mwCtI\" aria-labelledby=\"Idaho\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Idaho\">Idaho</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_gubernatorial_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=23\" title=\"Edit section: Idaho\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt1736\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwCtM\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Idaho gubernatorial election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Idaho\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2022 Idaho gubernatorial election\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2022\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2030 Idaho gubernatorial election\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2030&apos;&apos;\"},\"image_size\":{\"wt\":\"125x136px\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"Brad Little official photo (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Brad Little]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"TerriPickens-IdahoDemocrat, 1 (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"Terri Pickens\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image3\":{\"wt\":\"3x4.svg\"},\"nominee3\":{\"wt\":\"[[John Stegner]]\"},\"party3\":{\"wt\":\"Independent politician\"},\"popular_vote3\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage3\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"[[Governor of Idaho|Governor]]\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Brad Little]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt1737\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link 