at%2C_1_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-TerriPickens-IdahoDemocrat%2C_1_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"989\" data-file-height=\"1375\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"98\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #DCDCDC;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/120px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/250px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3\" data-file-height=\"4\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brad_Little\" title=\"Brad Little\">Brad Little</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Terri Pickens</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Stegner\" title=\"John Stegner\">John Stegner</a></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Independent_politician\" title=\"Independent politician\">Independent</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor_of_Idaho\" title=\"Governor of Idaho\" class=\"mw-redirect\">Governor</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brad_Little\" title=\"Brad Little\">Brad Little</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt1740\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwCtU\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 Idaho gubernatorial election\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt1741\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt1740\" id=\"mwCtY\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Idaho_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Idaho gubernatorial election\">2026 Idaho gubernatorial election</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt1742\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwCtc\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 Idaho lieutenant gubernatorial election\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt1743\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt1742\" id=\"mwCtg\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Idaho_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Idaho lieutenant gubernatorial election\">2026 Idaho lieutenant gubernatorial election</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwCtk\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor_of_Idaho\" title=\"Governor of Idaho\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwCto\">Governor</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brad_Little\" title=\"Brad Little\" id=\"mwCts\">Brad Little</a>, a Republican, was re-elected in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Idaho_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2022 Idaho gubernatorial election\" id=\"mwCtw\">2022</a> with 60.5% of the vote. Because <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Idaho\" title=\"Idaho\" id=\"mwCt0\">Idaho</a> does not have gubernatorial term limits in its <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Constitution_of_Idaho\" title=\"Constitution of Idaho\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwCt4\">Constitution</a>, he is running for re-election to a third term.<sup about=\"#mwt1746\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-158\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-158\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-158\" id=\"mwCt8\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwCuA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwCuE\">[</span>148<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwCuI\">]</span></span></a></sup></p> \n\n<p id=\"mwCuM\">Attorney Terri Pickens, who was the Democratic nominee for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lieutenant_Governor_of_Idaho\" title=\"Lieutenant Governor of Idaho\" id=\"mwCuQ\">lieutenant governor</a> in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Idaho_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2022 Idaho lieutenant gubernatorial election\" id=\"mwCuU\">2022</a>, is running for the Democratic gubernatorial nomination.<sup about=\"#mwt1749\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Pickens_159-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Pickens\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Pickens-159\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Pickens-159\" id=\"mwCuY\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwCuc\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwCug\">[</span>149<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwCuk\">]</span></span></a></sup></p> \n\n<p id=\"mwCuo\">Former <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Twin_Falls,_Idaho\" title=\"Twin Falls, Idaho\" id=\"mwCus\">Twin Falls</a> Transit Coordinator Maxine Durand is running as an independent, with the backing of local branches of the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Socialists_of_America\" title=\"Democratic Socialists of America\" id=\"mwCuw\">Democratic Socialists of America</a>.<sup about=\"#mwt1752\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Durand_160-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Durand\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Durand-160\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Durand-160\" id=\"mwCu0\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwCu4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwCu8\">[</span>150<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwCvA\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt1753\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwCvE\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"24\" id=\"mwCvI\" aria-labelledby=\"Illinois\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Illinois\">Illinois</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_gubernatorial_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=24\" title=\"Edit section: Illinois\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt1754\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwCvM\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Illinois gubernatorial election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Illinois\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2022 Illinois gubernatorial election\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2022\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2030 Illinois gubernatorial election\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2030&apos;&apos;\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"JB Pritzker 2026 (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[JB Pritzker]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"running_mate1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Christian Mitchell]]\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Darren Bailey at a 2022 Campaign Event (cropped2).jpg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Darren Bailey]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"running_mate2\":{\"wt\":\"Aaron Del Mar\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"200px\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"County results\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"[[Governor of Illinois|Governor]]\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[JB Pritzker]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt1755\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt1756\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt1757\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt1754\" id=\"mwCvQ\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Illinois gubernatorial election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Illinois.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Flag_of_Illinois.svg/60px-Flag_of_Illinois.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Flag_of_Illinois.svg/120px-Flag_of_Illinois.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"500\" data-file-height=\"300\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"30\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\