rder-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Sen._Marsha_Blackburn_(R-TN)_official_headshot_-_116th_Congress_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Sen._Marsha_Blackburn_(R-TN)_official_headshot_-_116th_Congress_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Sen._Marsha_Blackburn_%28R-TN%29_official_headshot_-_116th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Sen._Marsha_Blackburn_%28R-TN%29_official_headshot_-_116th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Sen._Marsha_Blackburn_%28R-TN%29_official_headshot_-_116th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Sen._Marsha_Blackburn_%28R-TN%29_official_headshot_-_116th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"803\" data-file-height=\"1097\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"110\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Jerri_Green_(cropped).3_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Jerri_Green_(cropped).3_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Jerri_Green_%28cropped%29.3_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Jerri_Green_%28cropped%29.3_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Jerri_Green_%28cropped%29.3_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Jerri_Green_%28cropped%29.3_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"916\" data-file-height=\"1237\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"111\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marsha_Blackburn\" title=\"Marsha Blackburn\">Marsha Blackburn</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Jerri Green</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor_of_Tennessee\" title=\"Governor of Tennessee\">Governor</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bill_Lee_(Tennessee_politician)\" title=\"Bill Lee (Tennessee politician)\">Bill Lee</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2230\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDhQ\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 Tennessee gubernatorial election\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2231\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2230\" id=\"mwDhU\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Tennessee_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Tennessee gubernatorial election\">2026 Tennessee gubernatorial election</a></div>\n\n<p id=\"mwDhY\">Republican Governor <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bill_Lee_(Tennessee_politician)\" title=\"Bill Lee (Tennessee politician)\" id=\"mwDhc\">Bill Lee</a> was re-elected in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Tennessee_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2022 Tennessee gubernatorial election\" id=\"mwDhg\">2022</a> with 64.9% of the vote. He will be term-limited by the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Constitution_of_Tennessee\" title=\"Constitution of Tennessee\" id=\"mwDhk\">Tennessee Constitution</a> in 2026 and cannot seek re-election to a third consecutive term. </p>\n\n<p id=\"mwDho\">U.S. Senator <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marsha_Blackburn\" title=\"Marsha Blackburn\" id=\"mwDhs\">Marsha Blackburn</a>,<sup about=\"#mwt2234\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-BlackburnTN_261-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"BlackburnTN\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-BlackburnTN-261\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-BlackburnTN-261\" id=\"mwDhw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDh0\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDh4\">[</span>249<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDh8\">]</span></span></a></sup> state representative <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monty_Fritts\" title=\"Monty Fritts\" id=\"mwDiA\">Monty Fritts</a>,<sup about=\"#mwt2237\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FrittsTN_262-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"FrittsTN\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FrittsTN-262\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-FrittsTN-262\" id=\"mwDiE\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDiI\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDiM\">[</span>250<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDiQ\">]</span></span></a></sup> and U.S. Representative for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tennessee's_6th_congressional_district\" title=\"Tennessee's 6th congressional district\" id=\"mwDiU\">Tennessee's 6th congressional district</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Rose_(Tennessee_politician)\" title=\"John Rose (Tennessee politician)\" id=\"mwDiY\">John Rose</a><sup about=\"#mwt2240\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Rose_263-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Rose\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Rose-263\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Rose-263\" id=\"mwDic\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDig\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDik\">[</span>251<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDio\">]</span></span></a></sup> ran for the Republican nomination. Blackburn won the nomination with 43.4% of the vote on August 6.</p>\n\n<p id=\"mwDis\">For the Democrats, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Memphis_City_Council\" title=\"Memphis City Council\" id=\"mwDiw\">Memphis city councilor</a> Jerri Green<sup about=\"#mwt2243\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-GreenTN_264-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"GreenTN\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-GreenTN-264\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-GreenTN-264\" id=\"mwDi0\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDi4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDi8\">[</span>252<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDjA\">]</span></span></a></sup> defeated leader of New Chicago Community Development Corporation and 2022 candidate for governor <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnita_Atwater\" title=\"Carnita Atwater\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwDjE\">Carnita Atwater</a>, nominee for the 109th district in the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illinois_House_of_Representatives\" title=\"Illinois House of Representatives\" id=\"mwDjI\">Illinois House of Representatives</a> in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_Illinois_House_of_Representatives_election\" title=\"2010 Illinois House of Representatives election\" id=\"mwDjM\">2010</a> Tim Cyr, and guitarist Adam Kurtz for the nomination.<sup about=\"#mwt2246\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Contested_265-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Contested\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Contested-265\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Contested-265\" id=\"mwDjQ\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDjU\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDjY\">[</span>253<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDjc\">]</span></span></a></sup></p> \n\n<p id=\"mwDjg\">Former <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lipscomb_University\" title=\"Lipscomb University\" id=\"mwDjk\">Lipscomb University</a> professor Lauren Pinkston is running as an independent.<sup about=\"#mwt2249\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Pinkston_266-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Pinkston\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Pinkston-266\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Pinkston-266\" id=\"mwDjo\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDjs\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDjw\">[</span>254<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDj0\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt2250\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDj4\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"45\" id=\"mwDj8\" aria-labelledby=\"Texas\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Texas\">Texas</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_gubernatorial_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=45\" title=\"Edit section: Texas\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2251\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDkA\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Texas gubernatorial election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Texas\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2022 Texas gubernatorial election\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2022\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2030 Texas gubernatorial election\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2030&apos;&apos;\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"Greg Abbott 2026.jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Greg Abbott]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Gina Hinojosa at LBJ Library Forum (3x4 cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Gina Hinojosa]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"County results\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"[[Governor of Texas|Governor]]\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Greg Abbott]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt2252\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt2253\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt2254\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt2251\" id=\"mwDkE\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Texas gubernatorial election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Texas.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Flag_of_Texas.svg/60px-Flag_of_Texas.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Flag_of_Texas.svg/120px-Flag_of_Texas.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"33\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Texas_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2022 Texas gubernatorial election\">2022</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2030</i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Greg_Abbott_2026.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Greg_Abbott_2026.jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Greg_Abbott_2026.jpg/120px-Greg_Abbott_2026.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Greg_Abbott_2026.jpg/250px-Greg_Abbott_2026.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2089\" data-file-height=\"2744\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"114\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Gina_Hinojosa_at_LBJ_Library_Forum_(3x4_cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Gina_Hinojosa_at_LBJ_Library_Forum_(3x4_cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Gina_Hinojosa_at_LBJ_Library_Forum_%283x4_cropped%29.jpg/120px-Gina_Hinojosa_at_LBJ_Library_Forum_%283x4_cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Gina_Hinojosa_at_LBJ_Library_Forum_%283x4_cropped%29.jpg/250px-Gina_Hinojosa_at_LBJ_Library_Forum_%283x4_cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"800\" data-file-height=\"1066\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greg_Abbott\" title=\"Greg Abbott\">Greg Abbott</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gina_Hinojosa\" title=\"Gina Hinojosa\">Gina Hinojosa</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor_of_Texas\" title=\"Governor of Texas\">Governor</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greg_Abbott\" title=\"Greg Abbott\">Greg Abbott</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2255\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDkI\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 Texas gubernatorial election\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2256\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2255\" id=\"mwDkM\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Texas_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Texas gubernatorial election\">2026 Texas gubernatorial election</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2257\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDkQ\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 Texas lieutenant gubernatorial election\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2258\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2257\" id=\"mwDkU\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Texas_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Texas lieutenant gubernatorial election\">2026 Texas lieutenant gubernatorial election</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwDkY\">Governor <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greg_Abbott\" title=\"Greg Abbott\" id=\"mwDkc\">Greg Abbott</a>, a Republican, was re-elected in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Texas_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2022 Texas gubernatorial election\" id=\"mwDkg\">2022</a> with 54.8% of the vote. Because <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Texas\" title=\"Texas\" id=\"mwDkk\">Texas</a> does not have gubernatorial term limits in its <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Constitution_of_Texas\" title=\"Constitution of Texas\" id=\"mwDko\">Constitution</a>, he is eligible to run for re-election to a fourth term. On March 1, 2024, Abbott announced his intention to seek re-election.<sup about=\"#mwt2261\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-absolutely_267-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"absolutely\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-absolutely-267\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-absolutely-267\" id=\"mwDks\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDkw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDk0\">[</span>255<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDk4\">]</span></span></a></sup> He won the primary with over 80% of the vote.<sup about=\"#mwt2264\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-268\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-268\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-268\" id=\"mwDk8\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDlA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDlE\">[</span>256<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDlI\">]</span></span></a></sup></p> \n\n<p id=\"mwDlM\">The Democratic nominee is state representative <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gina_Hinojosa\" title=\"Gina Hinojosa\" id=\"mwDlQ\">Gina Hinojosa</a>.<sup about=\"#mwt2267\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-269\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-269\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-269\" id=\"mwDlU\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDlY\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDlc\">[</span>257<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDlg\">]</span></span></a></sup> Hinojosa beat <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Bell_(politician)\" title=\"Chris Bell (politician)\" id=\"mwDlk\">Chris Bell</a>, a former U.S. representative for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Texas's_25th_congressional_district\" title=\"Texas's 25th congressional district\" id=\"mwDlo\">Texas's 25th congressional district</a> and former candidate for governor in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2006_Texas_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2006 Texas gubernatorial election\" id=\"mwDls\">2006</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mayor_of_Houston\" title=\"Mayor of Houston\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwDlw\">mayor of Houston</a> in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2001_Houston_mayoral_election\" title=\"2001 Houston mayoral election\" id=\"mwDl0\">2001</a> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2015_Houston_mayoral_election\" title=\"2015 Houston mayoral election\" id=\"mwDl4\">2015</a>, and U.S. Senate in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Texas\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Texas\" id=\"mwDl8\">2020</a>, and Bobby Cole, a rancher, in the primary.<sup about=\"#mwt2270\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-BellTX_270-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"BellTX\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-BellTX-270\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-BellTX-270\" id=\"mwDmA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDmE\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDmI\">[</span>258<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDmM\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt2273\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-HinojosaTX_271-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"HinojosaTX\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-HinojosaTX-271\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-HinojosaTX-271\" id=\"mwDmQ\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDmU\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDmY\">[</span>259<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDmc\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt2276\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ColeTX_272-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"ColeTX\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-ColeTX-272\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-ColeTX-272\" id=\"mwDmg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDmk\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDmo\">[</span>260<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDms\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt2277\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDmw\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"46\" id=\"mwDm0\" aria-labelledby=\"Vermont\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Vermont\">Vermont</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_gubernatorial_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=46\" title=\"Edit section: Vermont\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2278\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDm4\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Vermont gubernatorial election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Vermont\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2024 Vermont gubernatorial election\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2024\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2028 Vermont gubernatorial election\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"2028\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"Phil Scott 2019 (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Phil Scott]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Amanda Janoo at candidate forum in May 2026 (cropped).png\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"Amanda Janoo\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"[[Governor of Vermont|Governor]]\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Phil Scott]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt2279\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt2280\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt2281\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt2278\" id=\"mwDm8\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Vermont gubernatorial election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Vermont.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Flag_of_Vermont.svg/60px-Flag_of_Vermont.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Flag_of_Vermont.svg/120px-Flag_of_Vermont.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"800\" data-file-height=\"480\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"30\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_Vermont_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2024 Vermont gubernatorial election\">2024</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2028_Vermont_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2028 Vermont gubernatorial election\" class=\"mw-redirect\">2028</a><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Phil_Scott_2019_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Phil_Scott_2019_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Phil_Scott_2019_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Phil_Scott_2019_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Phil_Scott_2019_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Phil_Scott_2019_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"493\" data-file-height=\"657\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Amanda_Janoo_at_candidate_forum_in_May_2026_(cropped).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Amanda_Janoo_at_candidate_forum_in_May_2026_(cropped).png\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Amanda_Janoo_at_candidate_forum_in_May_2026_%28cropped%29.png/120px-Amanda_Janoo_at_candidate_forum_in_May_2026_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Amanda_Janoo_at_candidate_forum_in_May_2026_%28cropped%29.png/250px-Amanda_Janoo_at_candidate_forum_in_May_2026_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"498\" data-file-height=\"623\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phil_Scott\" title=\"Phil Scott\">Phil Scott</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Amanda Janoo</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor_of_Vermont\" title=\"Governor of Vermont\">Governor</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phil_Scott\" title=\"Phil Scott\">Phil Scott</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2282\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDnA\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 Vermont gubernatorial election\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2283\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2282\" id=\"mwDnE\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Vermont_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Vermont gubernatorial election\">2026 Vermont gubernatorial election</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2284\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDnI\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 Vermont lieutenant gubernatorial election\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2285\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2284\" id=\"mwDnM\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Vermont_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Vermont lieutenant gubernatorial election\">2026 Vermont lieutenant gubernatorial election</a></div>\n\n<p id=\"mwDnQ\">Governor <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phil_Scott\" title=\"Phil Scott\" id=\"mwDnU\">Phil Scott</a>, a Republican, was re-elected in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_Vermont_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2024 Vermont gubernatorial election\" id=\"mwDnY\">2024</a> with 73.4% of the vote. Scott is running for a sixth two-year term, declaring only hours before the filing deadline was required. He won the primary unopposed.<sup about=\"#mwt2289\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-273\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-273\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-273\" id=\"mwDnc\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDng\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDnk\">[</span>261<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDno\">]</span></span></a></sup></p> \n\n<p id=\"mwDns\">For the Democrats, economist Amanda Janoo is the nominee.<sup about=\"#mwt2292\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-274\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-274\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-274\" id=\"mwDnw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDn0\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDn4\">[</span>262<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDn8\">]</span></span></a></sup> She narrowly defeated former lobbying group CEO Aly Richards in the primary. <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vermont_Attorney_General\" title=\"Vermont Attorney General\" id=\"mwDoA\">Attorney General</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charity_Clark\" title=\"Charity Clark\" id=\"mwDoE\">Charity Clark</a> was considered a potential candidate and had previously said she that she would run for statewide office in 2026, but she instead decided to seek re-election to her current office.<sup about=\"#mwt2295\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-275\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-275\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-275\" id=\"mwDoI\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDoM\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDoQ\">[</span>263<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDoU\">]</span></span></a></sup> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vermont_State_Treasurer\" title=\"Vermont State Treasurer\" id=\"mwDoY\">State Treasurer</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mike_Pieciak\" title=\"Mike Pieciak\" id=\"mwDoc\">Mike Pieciak</a> was reported to have considered a campaign for the governor, but he too choose to seek re-election.<sup about=\"#mwt2298\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-276\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-276\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-276\" id=\"mwDog\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDok\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDoo\">[</span>264<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDos\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt2301\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-277\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-277\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-277\" id=\"mwDow\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDo0\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDo4\">[</span>265<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDo8\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwDpA\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dean_Roy\" title=\"Dean Roy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwDpE\">Dean Roy</a>, a 14-year-old from <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stowe,_Vermont\" title=\"Stowe, Vermont\" id=\"mwDpI\">Stowe</a>, is running as a member of the Freedom and Unity Party.<sup about=\"#mwt2304\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-278\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-278\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-278\" id=\"mwDpM\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDpQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDpU\">[</span>266<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDpY\">]</span></span></a></sup> Vermont has no minimum age requirement for the governorship, allowing Roy to seek the governorship despite not being old enough to vote.<sup about=\"#mwt2307\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-279\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-279\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-279\" id=\"mwDpc\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDpg\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDpk\">[</span>267<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDpo\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt2308\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDps\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"47\" id=\"mwDpw\" aria-labelledby=\"Wisconsin\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Wisconsin\">Wisconsin</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_gubernatorial_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=47\" title=\"Edit section: Wisconsin\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2309\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDp0\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Wisconsin gubernatorial election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Wisconsin\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2022 Wisconsin gubernatorial election\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2022\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2030 Wisconsin gubernatorial election\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"2030\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"David Crowley 2026 (3x4 crop).jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[David Crowley (Wisconsin politician)|David Crowley]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"running_mate1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Sarah Godlewski]]\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Tom Tiffany (alt crop).jpg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Tom Tiffany]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"running_mate2\":{\"wt\":\"David Varnam\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"[[Governor of Wisconsin|Governor]]\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Tony Evers]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"TBD\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"TBD\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt2310\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt2311\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt2312\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt2309\" id=\"mwDp4\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Wisconsin gubernatorial election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Wisconsin.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Flag_of_Wisconsin.svg/60px-Flag_of_Wisconsin.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Flag_of_Wisconsin.svg/120px-Flag_of_Wisconsin.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"200\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"33\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Wisconsin_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2022 Wisconsin gubernatorial election\">2022</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\">2030<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:David_Crowley_2026_(3x4_crop).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:David_Crowley_2026_(3x4_crop).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/David_Crowley_2026_%283x4_crop%29.jpg/120px-David_Crowley_2026_%283x4_crop%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/David_Crowley_2026_%283x4_crop%29.jpg/250px-David_Crowley_2026_%283x4_crop%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"659\" data-file-height=\"877\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"113\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Tom_Tiffany_(alt_crop).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Tom_Tiffany_(alt_crop).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Tom_Tiffany_%28alt_crop%29.jpg/120px-Tom_Tiffany_%28alt_crop%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Tom_Tiffany_%28alt_crop%29.jpg/250px-Tom_Tiffany_%28alt_crop%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1743\" data-file-height=\"2179\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Crowley_(Wisconsin_politician)\" title=\"David Crowley (Wisconsin politician)\">David Crowley</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Tiffany\" title=\"Tom Tiffany\">Tom Tiffany</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Running<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>mate</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sarah_Godlewski\" title=\"Sarah Godlewski\">Sarah Godlewski</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">David Varnam</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor_of_Wisconsin\" title=\"Governor of Wisconsin\">Governor</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tony_Evers\" title=\"Tony Evers\">Tony Evers</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2313\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDp8\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 Wisconsin gubernatorial election\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2314\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2313\" id=\"mwDqA\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Wisconsin_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Wisconsin gubernatorial election\">2026 Wisconsin gubernatorial election</a></div>\n\n<p id=\"mwDqE\">Governor <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tony_Evers\" title=\"Tony Evers\" id=\"mwDqI\">Tony Evers</a>, a Democrat, was re-elected in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Wisconsin_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2022 Wisconsin gubernatorial election\" id=\"mwDqM\">2022</a> with 51.2% of the vote. Despite <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wisconsin\" title=\"Wisconsin\" id=\"mwDqQ\">Wisconsin</a> not having gubernatorial term limits in its <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Constitution_of_Wisconsin\" title=\"Constitution of Wisconsin\" id=\"mwDqU\">Constitution</a>, Evers announced on July 24, 2025, that he would not seek re-election.<sup about=\"#mwt2317\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Evers_3-2\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Evers\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Evers-3\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Evers-3\" id=\"mwDqY\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDqc\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDqg\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDqk\">]</span></span></a></sup></p> \n\n<p id=\"mwDqo\">Former <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lieutenant_Governor_of_Wisconsin\" title=\"Lieutenant Governor of Wisconsin\" id=\"mwDqs\">Lieutenant Governor</a> and in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Wisconsin\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in Wisconsin\" id=\"mwDqw\">2022</a> nominee for U.S. Senate <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mandela_Barnes\" title=\"Mandela Barnes\" id=\"mwDq0\">Mandela Barnes</a>,<sup about=\"#mwt2320\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-MandelaWI_280-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"MandelaWI\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-MandelaWI-280\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-MandelaWI-280\" id=\"mwDq4\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDq8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDrA\">[</span>268<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDrE\">]</span></span></a></sup> state senator <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kelda_Roys\" title=\"Kelda Roys\" id=\"mwDrI\">Kelda Roys</a>,<sup about=\"#mwt2323\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-RoysWI_281-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"RoysWI\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-RoysWI-281\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-RoysWI-281\" id=\"mwDrM\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDrQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDrU\">[</span>269<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDrY\">]</span></span></a></sup> state representative <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francesca_Hong\" title=\"Francesca Hong\" id=\"mwDrc\">Francesca Hong</a>,<sup about=\"#mwt2326\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Hong_282-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Hong\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Hong-282\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Hong-282\" id=\"mwDrg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDrk\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDro\">[</span>270<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDrs\">]</span></span></a></sup> and Milwaukee County executive <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Crowley_(Wisconsin_politician)\" title=\"David Crowley (Wisconsin politician)\" id=\"mwDrw\">David Crowley</a><sup about=\"#mwt2329\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Crowley_82-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Crowley\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Crowley-82\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Crowley-82\" id=\"mwDr0\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDr4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDr8\">[</span>74<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDsA\">]</span></span></a></sup> have all announced campaigns for the Democratic nomination.</p>\n\n<p id=\"mwDsE\">U.S. Representative for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wisconsin's_7th_congressional_district\" title=\"Wisconsin's 7th congressional district\" id=\"mwDsI\">Wisconsin's 7th congressional district</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Tiffany\" title=\"Tom Tiffany\" id=\"mwDsM\">Tom Tiffany</a> and medical service technician Andy Manske<sup about=\"#mwt2332\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-283\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-283\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-283\" id=\"mwDsQ\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDsU\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDsY\">[</span>271<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDsc\">]</span></span></a></sup> have both announced campaigns for the Republican nomination.<sup about=\"#mwt2335\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Tiffany_83-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Tiffany\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Tiffany-83\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Tiffany-83\" id=\"mwDsg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDsk\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDso\">[</span>75<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDss\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt2336\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDsw\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"48\" id=\"mwDs0\" aria-labelledby=\"Wyoming\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Wyoming\">Wyoming</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_gubernatorial_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=48\" title=\"Edit section: Wyoming\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2337\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDs4\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Wyoming gubernatorial election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Wyoming\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2022 Wyoming gubernatorial election\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2022\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2030 Wyoming gubernatorial election\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"2030\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"3x4.svg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Eric Barlow]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"3x4.svg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"Kenneth Casner\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"[[Governor of Wyoming|Governor]]\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Mark Gordon]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt2338\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt2339\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt2340\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt2337\" id=\"mwDs8\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Wyoming gubernatorial election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Wyoming.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Flag_of_Wyoming.svg/60px-Flag_of_Wyoming.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Flag_of_Wyoming.svg/120px-Flag_of_Wyoming.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"700\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"35\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Wyoming_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2022 Wyoming gubernatorial election\">2022</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\">2030<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/120px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/250px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3\" data-file-height=\"4\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"150\" width=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/120px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/250px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3\" data-file-height=\"4\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"150\" width=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eric_Barlow\" title=\"Eric Barlow\">Eric Barlow</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Kenneth Casner</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor_of_Wyoming\" title=\"Governor of Wyoming\" class=\"mw-redirect\">Governor</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Gordon\" title=\"Mark Gordon\">Mark Gordon</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2341\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDtA\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 Wyoming gubernatorial election\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2342\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2341\" id=\"mwDtE\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Wyoming_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Wyoming gubernatorial election\">2026 Wyoming gubernatorial election</a></div>\n\n<p id=\"mwDtI\">Governor <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Gordon\" title=\"Mark Gordon\" id=\"mwDtM\">Mark Gordon</a>, a Republican, was re-elected in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Wyoming_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2022 Wyoming gubernatorial election\" id=\"mwDtQ\">2022</a> with 74.1% of the vote. He will be term-limited by state law in 2026 and cannot seek reelection to a third consecutive term.</p>\n\n<p id=\"mwDtU\">State senator <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eric_Barlow\" title=\"Eric Barlow\" id=\"mwDtY\">Eric Barlow</a><sup about=\"#mwt2345\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Barlow_84-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Barlow\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Barlow-84\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Barlow-84\" id=\"mwDtc\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDtg\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDtk\">[</span>76<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDto\">]</span></span></a></sup> defeated <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wyoming_Department_of_Education\" title=\"Wyoming Department of Education\" id=\"mwDts\">Wyoming Superintendent of Public Instruction</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Megan_Degenfelder\" title=\"Megan Degenfelder\" id=\"mwDtw\">Megan Degenfelder</a><sup about=\"#mwt2348\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-284\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-284\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-284\" id=\"mwDt0\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDt4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDt8\">[</span>272<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDuA\">]</span></span></a></sup> and civil engineer Brent Bien<sup about=\"#mwt2351\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:4_285-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":4\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-:4-285\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:4-285\" id=\"mwDuE\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDuI\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDuM\">[</span>273<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDuQ\">]</span></span></a></sup> for the Republican nomination. </p>\n\n<p id=\"mwDuU\">Perennial candidate Kenneth Casner is the Democratic nominee.<sup about=\"#mwt2354\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-286\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-286\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-286\" id=\"mwDuY\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDuc\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDug\">[</span>274<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDuk\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt2355\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDuo\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"49\" id=\"mwDus\" aria-labelledby=\"Territories_and_federal_district_2\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Territories_and_federal_district_2\">Territories and federal district</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_gubernatorial_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=49\" title=\"Edit section: Territories and federal district\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<section data-mw-section-id=\"50\" id=\"mwDuw\" aria-labelledby=\"District_of_Columbia\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"District_of_Columbia\">District of Columbia</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_gubernatorial_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=50\" title=\"Edit section: District of Columbia\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2356\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDu0\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Washington, D.C., mayoral election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"District of Columbia\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2022 Washington, D.C., mayoral election\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2022\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2030 Washington, D.C., mayoral election\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"2030\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"November 3, 2026\"},\"turnout\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"Janeese Lewis George Portrait September 2023 (cropped 2).jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Janeese Lewis George]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"District of Columbia Democratic State Committee\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Robert Gross, STG candidate, Mayor (cropped).png\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"Robert L. Gross\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"D.C. Statehood Green Party\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"[[Mayor of the District of Columbia|Mayor]]\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Muriel Bowser]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"District of Columbia Democratic State Committee\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt2357\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt2358\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt2359\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table vevent\" about=\"#mwt2356\" id=\"mwDu4\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Washington, D.C., mayoral election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Washington,_D.C.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Flag_of_Washington%2C_D.C.svg/60px-Flag_of_Washington%2C_D.C.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Flag_of_Washington%2C_D.C.svg/120px-Flag_of_Washington%2C_D.C.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"2000\" data-file-height=\"1000\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"25\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%; margin:1px; display:inline-table;\">\n<div style=\"display:table-cell; text-align:left; vertical-align:middle; padding:0 0.5em 0 0;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Washington,_D.C.,_mayoral_election\" title=\"2022 Washington, D.C., mayoral election\">2022</a></div>\n<div style=\"display:table-cell; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle; padding:0 1px;width:60%;\" class=\"\"><b>November 3, 2026</b></div>\n<div style=\"display:table-cell; text-align:right; vertical-align:middle; padding:0 0 0 0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\">2030<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Janeese_Lewis_George_Portrait_September_2023_(cropped_2).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Janeese_Lewis_George_Portrait_September_2023_(cropped_2).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Janeese_Lewis_George_Portrait_September_2023_%28cropped_2%29.jpg/120px-Janeese_Lewis_George_Portrait_September_2023_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Janeese_Lewis_George_Portrait_September_2023_%28cropped_2%29.jpg/250px-Janeese_Lewis_George_Portrait_September_2023_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"990\" data-file-height=\"1320\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #17AA5C;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Robert_Gross,_STG_candidate,_Mayor_(cropped).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Robert_Gross,_STG_candidate,_Mayor_(cropped).png\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Robert_Gross%2C_STG_candidate%2C_Mayor_%28cropped%29.png/120px-Robert_Gross%2C_STG_candidate%2C_Mayor_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Robert_Gross%2C_STG_candidate%2C_Mayor_%28cropped%29.png/250px-Robert_Gross%2C_STG_candidate%2C_Mayor_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"572\" data-file-height=\"763\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Janeese_Lewis_George\" title=\"Janeese Lewis George\">Janeese Lewis George</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Robert L. Gross</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/District_of_Columbia_Democratic_State_Committee\" title=\"District of Columbia Democratic State Committee\">Democratic</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/D.C._Statehood_Green_Party\" title=\"D.C. Statehood Green Party\">DC Statehood Green</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mayor_of_the_District_of_Columbia\" title=\"Mayor of the District of Columbia\">Mayor</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muriel_Bowser\" title=\"Muriel Bowser\">Muriel Bowser</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/District_of_Columbia_Democratic_State_Committee\" title=\"District of Columbia Democratic State Committee\">Democratic</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2360\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDu8\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 Washington, D.C., mayoral election\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2361\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2360\" id=\"mwDvA\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Washington,_D.C.,_mayoral_election\" title=\"2026 Washington, D.C., mayoral election\">2026 Washington, D.C., mayoral election</a></div>\n\n<p id=\"mwDvE\">Mayor <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muriel_Bowser\" title=\"Muriel Bowser\" id=\"mwDvI\">Muriel Bowser</a> was re-elected in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Washington,_D.C.,_mayoral_election\" title=\"2022 Washington, D.C., mayoral election\" id=\"mwDvM\">2022</a> with 74.6% of the vote. She is retiring and will not seek a fourth term.<sup about=\"#mwt2364\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-287\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-287\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-287\" id=\"mwDvQ\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDvU\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDvY\">[</span>275<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDvc\">]</span></span></a></sup> Councilmember <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Janeese_Lewis_George\" title=\"Janeese Lewis George\" id=\"mwDvg\">Janeese Lewis George</a> is the Democratic nominee.<sup about=\"#mwt2367\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-288\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-288\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-288\" id=\"mwDvk\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDvo\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDvs\">[</span>276<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDvw\">]</span></span></a></sup> Information technology specialist Robert L. Gross is the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DC_Statehood_Party\" title=\"DC Statehood Party\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwDv0\">DC Statehood Party</a> nominee.<sup about=\"#mwt2370\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:0_289-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":0\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-:0-289\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:0-289\" id=\"mwDv4\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDv8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDwA\">[</span>277<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDwE\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt2371\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDwI\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"51\" id=\"mwDwM\" aria-labelledby=\"Guam\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Guam\">Guam</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_gubernatorial_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=51\" title=\"Edit section: Guam\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2372\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDwQ\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Guam gubernatorial election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Guam\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential&lt;!--DON&apos;T SET TO GUBERNATORIAL, THE INFOBOX DOESN&apos;T RECOGNIZE THAT TYPE. WE ALWAYS SET STATEWIDE ELECTIONS TO PRESIDENTIAL TYPE-->\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2022 Guam gubernatorial election\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2022\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2030 Guam gubernatorial election\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"2030\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"November 3, 2026\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"Therese Terlaje at Indo Pacific Command.jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Therese Terlaje]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"running_mate1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Sabina Perez]]\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Vicente Tony Ada at JRM Leadership Meeting May 2025.jpg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Vicente Ada]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"running_mate2\":{\"wt\":\"Edward Calvo\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"[[Governor of Guam|Governor]]\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Lou Leon Guerrero]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"turnout\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt2373\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt2374\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt2375\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table vevent\" about=\"#mwt2372\" id=\"mwDwU\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Guam gubernatorial election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Guam.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/Flag_of_Guam.svg/60px-Flag_of_Guam.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/Flag_of_Guam.svg/120px-Flag_of_Guam.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"738\" data-file-height=\"396\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"27\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%; margin:1px; display:inline-table;\">\n<div style=\"display:table-cell; text-align:left; vert