ze\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Vicente_Tony_Ada_at_JRM_Leadership_Meeting_May_2025.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Vicente_Tony_Ada_at_JRM_Leadership_Meeting_May_2025.jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Vicente_Tony_Ada_at_JRM_Leadership_Meeting_May_2025.jpg/120px-Vicente_Tony_Ada_at_JRM_Leadership_Meeting_May_2025.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Vicente_Tony_Ada_at_JRM_Leadership_Meeting_May_2025.jpg/250px-Vicente_Tony_Ada_at_JRM_Leadership_Meeting_May_2025.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"375\" data-file-height=\"500\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"150\" width=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Therese_Terlaje\" title=\"Therese Terlaje\">Therese Terlaje</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vicente_Ada\" title=\"Vicente Ada\">Vicente Ada</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Running<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>mate</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sabina_Perez\" title=\"Sabina Perez\">Sabina Perez</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Edward Calvo</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor_of_Guam\" title=\"Governor of Guam\" class=\"mw-redirect\">Governor</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lou_Leon_Guerrero\" title=\"Lou Leon Guerrero\">Lou Leon Guerrero</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2376\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDwY\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 Guam gubernatorial election\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2377\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2376\" id=\"mwDwc\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Guam_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Guam gubernatorial election\">2026 Guam gubernatorial election</a></div>\n\n<p id=\"mwDwg\">Governor <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lou_Leon_Guerrero\" title=\"Lou Leon Guerrero\" id=\"mwDwk\">Lou Leon Guerrero</a> was re-elected in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Guamanian_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2022 Guamanian gubernatorial election\" id=\"mwDwo\">2022</a> with 55.5% of the vote. She will be term limited in 2026 and cannot seek re-election for a third consecutive term. Lieutenant Governor <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Josh_Tenorio\" title=\"Josh Tenorio\" id=\"mwDws\">Josh Tenorio</a>, a Democrat elected alongside Leon Guerrero, announced in 2023 that he would pursue the governorship in 2026.<sup about=\"#mwt2380\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-tenorio_290-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"tenorio\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-tenorio-290\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-tenorio-290\" id=\"mwDww\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDw0\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDw4\">[</span>278<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDw8\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt2381\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDxA\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"52\" id=\"mwDxE\" aria-labelledby=\"Northern_Mariana_Islands\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Northern_Mariana_Islands\">Northern Mariana Islands</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_gubernatorial_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=52\" title=\"Edit section: Northern Mariana Islands\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2382\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDxI\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"In